'''Broken''' is a [[Legendary Weapons|legendary]] knife that was originally obtainable by collecting 4,000 [[Hearts (Currency)|Hearts]] {{Currency|Heart}} during the [[Valentines Event 2023|2023 Valentines Event]]. It is now only obtainable through trading as the event has since ended.

==Appearance==
Its blade is constructed out of dark gray cracked stone. Three purple gemstones can be seen scattered along the blade, and engraved in the center is a broken purple heart, hence the name. The guard is purple, and the handle is dark gray with purple fabric wrapped around it.

